  "title": "wsutil: Fix nstime_delta when the result and a are the same pointer",
  "description": "Rearrange the order of operations a bit so that when the result is\nstored in a pointer to the same object as a the result is correct.\n\nFixup af007c7894d833f326255668aa598bbd4862f38e\nFix #21426\n\n(There's a separate qcustomplot bug that causes aborts when using\nthe Time of Day toggle when compiled in Debug mode on Qt 6.10 and\nlater, due to overflow checks added in\nhttps://github.com/qt/qtbase/commit/1145e1709d1072f7dd45683e9c25a14615603854\nThat will be addressed separately.)",
